1
00:00:00,500 --> 00:00:05,298
Every week, a planner at a building-materials
retailer must decide which

2
00:00:05,348 --> 00:00:09,706
supplier and which existing warehouse
should serve each customer zone.

3
00:00:09,756 --> 00:00:17,199
Today that is done by habit, one leg at
a time, so total cost is never seen.

4
00:00:17,249 --> 00:00:20,284
Nordic Flow is a planner-approved
optimisation service.

5
00:00:20,334 --> 00:00:24,251
It calculates the lowest-cost allocation,
checks it independently, explains

6
00:00:24,301 --> 00:00:27,777
it, and waits for a human to approve.

7
00:00:27,827 --> 00:00:31,744
Everything you will see runs
locally, on synthetic data.

8
00:00:32,500 --> 00:00:38,199
Since our Round 1 proposal, five
things changed, and here is why.

9
00:00:38,249 --> 00:00:44,428
First, we use synthetic data, because
Company A's data is not available; every

10
00:00:44,478 --> 00:00:45,865
screen says so.

11
00:00:45,915 --> 00:00:52,093
Second, we added what-if scenarios, an
approval gate and an audit trail, so

12
00:00:52,143 --> 00:00:57,842
"the planner approves and every decision
is logged" is shown, not promised.

13
00:00:57,892 --> 00:01:01,675
Third, learning from
overrides stays in phase two.

14
00:01:01,725 --> 00:01:06,466
Fourth, there is no ERP
connection: files in, files out.

15
00:01:06,516 --> 00:01:12,215
Fifth, as an optional extension, the
engine can also handle transfers between

16
00:01:12,265 --> 00:01:13,174
existing warehouses.

17
00:01:16,000 --> 00:01:23,140
A planner starts by uploading this week's
files: eight CSV files in one ZIP,

18
00:01:23,190 --> 00:01:25,708
as exported from their systems.

19
00:01:25,758 --> 00:01:29,817
Before anything is calculated,
every file is checked.

20
00:01:29,867 --> 00:01:35,980
Here the data is valid: two suppliers,
three warehouses, six customer zones,

21
00:01:36,030 --> 00:01:39,061
twenty products, 606 pallets of demand.

22
00:01:52,000 --> 00:01:54,576
What if the data is wrong?

23
00:01:54,626 --> 00:01:57,640
This file declares a
loop between warehouses.

24
00:01:57,690 --> 00:02:01,580
The system blocks the
run and says exactly why.

25
00:02:01,630 --> 00:02:02,893
It never guesses.

26
00:02:16,000 --> 00:02:17,871
We calculate the plan.

27
00:02:17,921 --> 00:02:24,116
The optimiser finds a plan costing
31,316 cost units against 32,698 for the

28
00:02:24,166 --> 00:02:27,959
baseline, a saving of
1,382, or 4.2 percent.

29
00:02:28,009 --> 00:02:28,920
Two cautions.

30
00:02:28,970 --> 00:02:33,724
The data is synthetic, so
this is not a forecast.

31
00:02:33,774 --> 00:02:40,929
And the baseline is a simple rule that
prefers one warehouse per zone; it is

32
00:02:40,979 --> 00:02:43,331
not Company A's actual plan.

33
00:02:43,381 --> 00:02:50,056
If that baseline could not serve all
demand, the system would show no saving

34
00:02:50,106 --> 00:02:51,017
at all.

35
00:02:51,067 --> 00:02:56,781
The checks passed: an independent
verifier, which does not use the solver,

36
00:02:56,831 --> 00:02:59,663
re-checked supply, demand,
capacity and lanes.

37
00:02:59,713 --> 00:03:02,546
The diagram shows where goods move.

38
00:03:02,596 --> 00:03:09,751
The ranking prices every full path,
leg by leg, so the planner can see why.

39
00:03:14,000 --> 00:03:15,459
Now the explanation.

40
00:03:15,509 --> 00:03:17,975
Our code calculates the numbers.

41
00:03:18,025 --> 00:03:22,503
The AI assistant only rewrites
them in plain language.

42
00:03:28,000 --> 00:03:33,138
Every figure in the text must match the
calculated facts, so a made-up number

43
00:03:33,188 --> 00:03:34,620
rejects the whole draft.

44
00:03:34,670 --> 00:03:39,808
Here is that guard in action: a draft
with correct figures is accepted; a

45
00:03:39,858 --> 00:03:42,402
draft that invents a figure is rejected.

46
00:03:50,000 --> 00:03:53,070
And the text is only a draft.

47
00:03:53,120 --> 00:03:58,864
The planner reads it, checks the supporting
figures, edits it and approves it.

48
00:03:58,914 --> 00:04:01,093
AI helps; a person decides.

49
00:04:08,000 --> 00:04:10,441
Now the planner overrides the machine.

50
00:04:10,491 --> 00:04:15,839
A customer contract says Zone 1 must
receive its cement from Warehouse B.

51
00:04:15,889 --> 00:04:19,991
The planner fixes eight
pallets and must give a reason.

52
00:04:20,041 --> 00:04:24,973
The system recalculates everything else
around that decision as a new version,

53
00:04:25,023 --> 00:04:28,295
and shows its price: plus 88 cost units.

54
00:04:28,345 --> 00:04:30,371
The original plan is kept.

55
00:04:55,000 --> 00:04:57,028
The planner approves the plan.

56
00:04:57,078 --> 00:05:02,430
From this moment it is locked,
and only now can it be exported.

57
00:05:02,480 --> 00:05:04,923
Trying to export earlier is refused.

58
00:05:12,000 --> 00:05:18,338
The export is a ZIP for the existing
ERP, warehouse and transport systems.

59
00:05:18,388 --> 00:05:20,303
Nordic Flow executes nothing.

60
00:05:27,000 --> 00:05:29,776
The audit trail records every step.

61
00:05:29,826 --> 00:05:35,900
Each entry is linked to the one
before, so any edit is detectable:

62
00:05:35,950 --> 00:05:37,313
tamper-evident, not tamper-proof.

63
00:05:43,000 --> 00:05:46,162
The planner can also ask "what if".

64
00:05:46,212 --> 00:05:49,833
If Warehouse A closes,
no feasible plan exists.

65
00:05:49,883 --> 00:05:55,798
The system says so, with the likely
cause: total capacity is below demand.

66
00:05:55,848 --> 00:05:58,092
It never invents a route.

67
00:06:09,000 --> 00:06:15,659
In short: the core is an optimiser with
an independent check, an AI that only

68
00:06:15,709 --> 00:06:18,343
explains, and a human who approves.

69
00:06:18,393 --> 00:06:23,710
The limits are clear: synthetic data,
one planning period, no ERP integration.

70
00:06:23,760 --> 00:06:29,524
The Round 1 gates, such as five
percent savings and thirty percent less

71
00:06:29,574 --> 00:06:33,102
planning time, need real data in a pilot.

72
00:06:33,152 --> 00:06:36,681
This MVP proves the
mechanism, not the number.

73
00:06:36,731 --> 00:06:37,575
Thank you.
